   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at contributing to enhanced respect for human rights, rule of law and democracy in Azerbaijan, by strengthening the capacity of the Office of the Human Rights Commissioner (OHRC), enabling it to more efficiently carry out its mandate. The project partners are OHRC, UNDP Azerbaijan and the Raoul Wallenberg  Institute. The project period is three years.</narrative>
